# here, even though nothing on main contains it.
#
# Fingerprints are also commit-pinned, so the same fixture reappearing under a new SHA (a rebase,
# a cherry-pick, or a second branch introducing the same line) is reported again and needs another
# entry. A rule and path allowlist would end both problems; tracked in pickforge/picklab#60.
